    <tags>sweepr deepblock adblocker privacy cookie-banner manifest-v3 edge chrome brave</tags>
    <summary>Native Manifest V3 ad blocker, auto GDPR cookie rejector, AI slop filter, and browser RAM optimizer installer.</summary>
    <description>SWEEPR Deepblock 1-Click Browser Installer configures the SWEEPR Deepblock Manifest V3 extension across Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, and Brave with 253+ declarativeNetRequest rules, automated GDPR/CMP Reject All cookie consent dismissal, fake e-commerce store inspection, search AI-slop filtering, and background tab memory controls.

Silent install supports `/S` (or `/silent`, `--silent`, `/qn`) and silent uninstall supports `--uninstall /S`.</description>
    <releaseNotes>v1.2.9 adds native silent installation (`/S`), silent uninstallation (`--uninstall /S`), Windows Uninstall registry integration (`SWEEPR.Deepblock`), 253 C++ declarativeNetRequest rules, and updated cookie-consent &amp; anti-scam filters.</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 SWEEPR Global Limited</copyright>
